From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pear <pear@localhost>
Date: Mon, 17 Sep 2001 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [data] feat: data.pixel_dtype, the dtype the agent loop
 stores pixel tensors in

The agent loop casts the processor's pixel_values and pixel_values_videos to data.pixel_dtype, e.g. bf16, which
halves their bytes in every stored trajectory. null, the default, keeps the processor's dtype.
---
